                )
          %h3#motivic_donaldsonthomas_invariants Motivic Donaldson-Thomas invariants
          %p The original articles are
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dominic+Joyce"}> Dominic Joyce
                , Yinan Song,
                %em A theory of generalized Donaldson-Thomas invariants
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0810.5645"}> arxiv/0810.5645
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Maxim+Kontsevich"}> Maxim Kontsevich
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yan+Soibelman"} Yan Soibelman
                = succeed "," do
